WEBVTT

00:01.280 --> 00:07.520
Yuanzhi here you go down first say that bringing a large army into the city during the day is dangerous easy for the Wuzhao to take advantage.

00:07.600 --> 00:13.880
Wait until nightfall then have someone open the gates have the volunteers enter in groups at the same time send them another batch of grain.

00:13.960 --> 00:15.480
Don't let them cause trouble.

00:15.560 --> 00:17.400
Your subject receives orders.

00:20.720 --> 00:25.280
After nightfall you come with me to the volunteer army camp yes.

00:43.160 --> 00:44.560
Find Liu Dadao's tent.

00:55.960 --> 00:57.360
Halt.

01:05.440 --> 01:06.720
Which family are you two from?

01:06.800 --> 01:08.200
You look unfamiliar.

01:11.880 --> 01:15.000
Right now in this area there are only the three of us.

